ack but  this was to no avail as he was hostile  and proceeded to cut a chunk out of my  back  i had no clue how to react to this i  just ran away  this realization is too horrible for me  to stay plainly my suspicions have all  been but confirmed it all adds up  the tissue analyzer coming up at zero  the transition of human tracks in the  snow to those tentacular  things  something occurred  the time in space is all messed up due  to this beast  i will leave this to the consideration  of the reader whoever finds this log  i hope it is not me this time  okay  this concludes today's lecture  thank you for listening if indeed you  still are  and you're all dismissed  goodbye  i would like to give a special thank you  to  anvil  aletreon  derivative  zargeron  professor puffer  retalias  tailored printers  clad the lad  perpetually confused mate tech pilot  signor  your local foundation agent  gabriel hawkins  nate decline  lost boy  a real american hebrew  sayo dio damnatis  eric corbige  longinus  the morrigan  karim el ashmuy  james saba  and nj bojack if you would like a  special thank you at the end of each of  my videos and some other cool stuff as  well visit patreon.com  forward slash thevogen  thank you  you

